s1 bad values	:: Annex, Grand, Hall, Horizontal, IrisA, IrisS, Large, Massive, Minimal, Ops,
s1 bad values	:: Available gates ::
s1 bad values	:: Cleared N previews.
s1 bad values	:: GATE_DIAL_SPIN = NONE
s1 bad values	:: GATE_IRIS_ANIMATION = sweep
s1 bad values	:: GATE_SOUNDS_ENABLED = true
s1 bad values	:: GATE_SOUND_VOLUME = N
s1 bad values	:: How a dialling gate's inner ring light moves before each chevron locks: TOP, CHEVRON, LAP, FILL, PEGASUS, CHASE, UNIVERSE, OVERSHOOT or NONE. Each is described in the gate guide. TOP rests half a second on the top chevron after each lock, and UNIVERSE turns at its own pace, so both dial a little slower.
s1 bad values	:: How a ring stack deploys: CONCURRENT (all at once) or SEQUENTIAL (one at a time).
s1 bad values	:: How an iris crosses its opening: sweep (rings, from the rim in), spiral (a wedge turning outwards), rows (top and bottom in), columns (both sides in), or instant. Only the picture moves; the blocks are placed in one go whichever it is.
s1 bad values	:: How loud gate sounds are. Volume also sets audible range: N carries about twenty-four blocks.
s1 bad values	:: How much the plugin logs: SEVERE, WARNING, INFO, CONFIG, FINE, FINER or FINEST, least to most.
s1 bad values	:: LOG_LEVEL = INFO
s1 bad values	:: Ops to Lab (ID) — world, PUBLIC, CONCURRENT/CONCURRENT
s1 bad values	:: RING_COOLDOWN_TICKS = N
s1 bad values	:: RING_DEFAULT_ACCESS = PRIVATE
s1 bad values	:: RING_DEFAULT_LIGHT = REDSTONE_LAMP
s1 bad values	:: RING_DEFAULT_STYLE = CONCURRENT
s1 bad values	:: Range, Relay, Standard
s1 bad values	:: Relay has been closed, darkened and its iris opened.
s1 bad values	:: Ticks a ring pair refuses to fire again after a cycle. Shared by both ends.
s1 bad values	:: What a newly built ring pair starts as: PUBLIC or PRIVATE.
s1 bad values	:: What the ring pad lights up as while it is working.
s1 bad values	:: Whether stargates make any noise. Everything below is ignored when this is false.
s1 bad values	:: error :: GATE_DIAL_SPIN is CHEVRON, TOP, LAP, FILL, PEGASUS, CHASE, UNIVERSE, OVERSHOOT or NONE, not "wobble".
s1 bad values	:: error :: GATE_IRIS_ANIMATION is sweep, spiral, rows, columns, instant, not "wobble".
s1 bad values	:: error :: GATE_SOUNDS_ENABLED is true or false, not "loud".
s1 bad values	:: error :: GATE_SOUND_VOLUME is a number, not "quiet".
s1 bad values	:: error :: LOG_LEVEL is SEVERE, WARNING, INFO, CONFIG, FINE, FINER, FINEST, ALL or OFF, not "LOUD".
s1 bad values	:: error :: RING_COOLDOWN_TICKS is a number, not "N".
s1 bad values	:: error :: RING_DEFAULT_ACCESS is PUBLIC or PRIVATE, not "open".
s1 bad values	:: error :: RING_DEFAULT_LIGHT is the name of a block, not "diamond".
s1 bad values	:: error :: RING_DEFAULT_STYLE is CONCURRENT or SEQUENTIAL, not "zigzag". Fast and slow work too.
s1 bad values	:: error :: You have no half-built ring pair.
s1 bad values	:: error :: You lack the permissions to do this.
